abstract: >-
  Pure-Python mathematical core of a physics-informed grey-box digital twin for
  reciprocating internal combustion engines, implementing ISO 19848:2018 / SFI 601
  automotive-to-maritime polymorphism, orthogonal fault-subspace projection, and
  full-rank 8-fault multi-regime observability.
keywords:
  - digital-twin
  - grey-box-modeling
  - internal-combustion-engine
  - iso-19848
  - fault-isolation
  - orthogonal-projection
  - observability
